    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{7}{12}$ of the book.",
      "worked": "Read before the weekend:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{5}{36}+\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{1}{6}&=\\frac{5}{36}+\\frac{4}{36}+\\frac{6}{36}\\\\&=\\frac{15}{36}=\\frac{5}{12}\\end{align*}$$\nRead over the weekend:\n$$\\begin{align*}1-\\frac{5}{12}&=\\frac{12}{12}-\\frac{5}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{7}{12}\\end{align*}$$\nHe read $\\frac{7}{12}$ of the book over the weekend.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
